OL,3,GNEWSAMedal-winner's 'superhero' tribute
OL,4,Aas coach retires
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first British woman to win an
OL,7,Findividual marathon medal at the
OL,8,FEuropean Championships has paid tribute
OL,9,Fto her "superhero" former coach on his
OL,10,Fretirement after almost 40 years.
OL,12,FRob Lewis, 83, volunteered at Lincoln
OL,13,FWellington Athletic Club where he
OL,14,Fcoached many athletes, including a
OL,15,Fyoung Abbie Donnelly who went on to
OL,16,Fclinch the European bronze medal in
OL,17,FBirmingham on Sunday.
OL,19,FThe club celebrated his final shift on
OL,20,FTuesday with Donnelly in attendance.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
