OL,3,GNEWSAMedal-winner's 'superhero' tribute
OL,4,Aas coach retires
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "Rob's been an absolute
OL,7,Fsuperhero for me and the whole group to
OL,8,Fbe honest. He's made my own running
OL,9,Fjourney possible."
